		6 Crystalariums destroyed by Emyly & Sandy

Solar Farm
	Location: Calico Desert
	8 Solar Panels
	Produce 8 Battery Packs every 7 days
	Allow crafting 8 new Crystalariums per week
	Current Status
		Solar Panels				16
			Status					Ready to harvest

Steps
	Pre-first Sunday
		Forge 50 Iridium Bars
		Forge 26 Refined Quartz

	First Sunday
		Grab all Diamonds
		Grab all Rubies
		Grab all Jades
		Craft 8 Solar Panels
		Craft 56 Crystalariums
		Go to Calico Desert
		Place Solar Panels
		Place Crystalariums
		Feed 35 Crystalariums with Diamonds
		Feed 21 Crystalariums with Rubies
		Trade remaining Diamonds
		Trade remaining Rubies
		Trade all Jades

	Every other Sunday
		Grab all Jades
		Go to Calico Desert through Desert Obelisk
		Collect all Diamonds
		Collect all Rubies
		Collect all Battery Packs
		Trade all Diamonds
		Trade all Rubies
		Trade all Jades
		Use the bus to go back to Farm
		Store all Battery Packs
